       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n**Sertraline 1000 mg once daily is 5 times the maximum recommended adult dose.** For adults, sertraline usually starts at 25\u201350 mg once daily, and the most it should go up to is 200 mg/day. A daily dose of 1000 mg would be an overdose and could cause serotonin syndrome, seizures or QT prolongation.\n\nThis may be a typo, for example an extra zero on **100 mg**. Can you confirm the dose you want? For example:\n- **Sertraline 100 mg by mouth once daily**\n- **Sertraline 50 mg by mouth once daily** (a typical starting dose)\n- Some other dose up to 200 mg/day\n\nOnce you confirm, I'll enter the order right away."
